    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i thought about that, but it feels pointless. i've tried the whole 'talking it out' thing and it doesn't change the fact that everything is just... muted. the color is gone. it's like i'm watching my own life happen from behind a thick sheet of glass. i feel like i'm just taking up space, waiting for something that's never gonna happen. i'm just so tired of the static.",
